.Lanon.392e6066d40d69151966a79cd1183c3e.9:
	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`\200\272\000, the index's own link points back to itself \342\200\224 a self-loop, corrupting the free-list into a cycle: pop_index's truncating pack would silently re-issue this same index to a second owner"
